From 198532fc5b00283684a06d3ae829a21725e259c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AuraLite <auralite@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:52:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FPU F3: transcendentals and BCD -- the x87 closes

Phase F3 of docs/plans/FPU_PLAN.md lands the last numeric surface.  All
eight transcendentals run their real encodings against the host x87 (the
F2 silicon-exact policy: raw bytes, never GAS mnemonics), so payload
digits, NaN folding and the odd corners come out of the very unit the
ISA describes.  The FNINIT-isolated host probes (transprobe{,2..7} --
the first run taught that FNCLEX does NOT clear C1) measure: FPATAN is
atan2(ST1,ST0) with the full signed-zero quadrant table; |x| >= 2^63
leaves the source unchanged with C2=1 and FPTAN/FSINCOS do not push;
inf input puts QNaN-indefinite in BOTH pair slots (SNaN quiets into
both) and a full stack faults with IE|SF|C1=1 and indefinite in the two
written slots.  Quirks pinned by vectors: FYL2X with x=0,y=+-inf gives
-+inf WITHOUT ZE; FYL2XP1 with x <= -1 returns ST0 for finite nonzero
ST1 (PE) and ST0*ST1 for ST1 of 0/+-inf; F2XM1 with finite |x| > 1
returns the source with PE (-inf -> -1.0).

C-flag policy is measured, not assumed: preset probes show every op
writes C1 (round-up indicator) and the trig four also write C2, while
C0/C3 -- and C2 on F2XM1/FYL2X/FYL2XP1/FPATAN -- survive from before on
silicon.  The engine preserves those bits instead of copying unmeasured
host flags.

FBSTP now rounds per FCW.RC (ties-to-even), tracks PE and the C1
magnitude-up rule, keeps the source sign even for zero, and stores the
QNaN-indefinite byte pattern with IE on NaN/Inf/1e18 overflow; denormal
sources raise no DE (host receipt).  FBLD is pinned as the weighted
nibble sum it measures to be (A-F count 10-15, no invalid-digit IE,
sign = bit7 of byte 9).

Vectors: tests/test_fpu.c F3 suites (44 groups total): payload pins,
the 2^63 boundary, NaN/inf stack shape, the full-stack push fault on
distinct canaries, FYL2X/FYL2XP1 corners, atan2 quadrants, F2XM1
domain, the C-flag write policy and the FBSTP RC matrix + invalid
forms.  Negative control: reverting the engine to the F2 tree reddens
114 checks.  The frozen T-row pin reaches its permanent edge -- "D9 D1",
the architecturally reserved hole, #UD forever -- after "D9 C0" (F1),
"D8 C1" (F2) and "D9 F0" (F3) fell phase by phase.

Gates: make test and make test-sanitize green (5-platform smoke, USB,
NET and BOOT lanes byte-stable), diff-fuzz 512 programs / 12288
instructions all-match (0 host crashes), both SeaBIOS ISO lanes green
(MBR + El Torito).  Docs synced in this commit: the plan gains its F3
receipt section (1d), CHANGELOG records patch 0074, STATUS closes the
transcendentals paragraph.
